    "bio": "So far in my life I have faced many challenges and different situations. Some were easier to overcome, some were harder, some are things I am still working on now, but overall I think so far in my life I have grown up a lot. Change is still something I am learning to get used to, but I have learned a lot that not a lot of things stay the same for long when I first enter college and it has taught me how to be more adaptive. I think growing up lately and seeing some many things change was a sort of wake up call that I needed to step up and be more reliant on myself because I am getting closer when I cannot rely on the feeling that I have that safety net for me all the time. I feel for a long time change used to scare me and while I still have doubts and concerns I am still ready to face things heads on and to be able to have a plan for the future, but still be ok with all things that come my way that I cannot plan ahead. I also want to be there for myself more because I have been too harsh on myself in the past and even now when I should appreciate all the things I have overcome. I have gone through a lot, but I know there is more to come and I am excited to learn more about myself and grow even more as a person.",
